0: jdbc:hive2://localhost:10000> -- Q2  CUBE: where are orders lost? Every combination of intake channel and outcome group.
0: jdbc:hive2://localhost:10000> SELECT c.channel_name, o.outcome_group, SUM(f.order_count) AS orders
